"}, {"title": "Punjab begins mapping legitimate raw material supply for stone crushers", "para": "The Punjab Pollution Control Board is currently evaluating legitimate sources of raw materials for stone crushers. This scrutiny is designed to guarantee adherence to state regulations and policies. In the Ropar district, a significant number of stone crushers obtain materials from Punjab, Haryana, and Himachal Pradesh. Alarmingly, over 42% of these units have been found to violate pollution control laws.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/allied-industries/punjab-begins-mapping-legitimate-raw-material-supply-for-stone-crushers/133255470?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-280776/133255470.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "allied-industries"}]}